From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:21:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 158/202] [ae-patch] Read the old rail switch as both, refresh
 the slot limit after a policy save, and share one Update branch mutation

- aeSessionRail: a layout saved before Settings > Chat's choice, with the old
  "Open the session rail in every session" switch on or never set, loads as
  `both`, which is how that switch behaved (it closed a restored panel only
  when the two did not fit); it loaded as `rail` and closed the panel.
- useDefaultPolicies: adding, editing or removing a global policy asks for the
  slot limit again (refreshAeSlotLimit), so a new slot cap limit reaches every
  count at once instead of after the five-minute stale time.
- useAeUpdateBranch: the mutation moves into useAeUpdateBranchMutation(repo,
  number), which the PR card now uses too, instead of a second copy of the
  same options.
